  "flavor": "A warm sun casts a gentle glow over the rolling hills of Briarwood, where wildflowers sway in the breeze and the sound of laughter carries on the wind. But amidst this peaceful scene, a sense of worry hangs in the air - Luna, the village puppy, has gone missing!"
